{
  "uid": "bank-slo",
  "title": "Bank USAC · SLO y error budget",
  "tags": [
    "bank-usac",
    "slo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "Los cinco SLO que la Fase 3 mide con datos reales (docs/sre/sli-slo-sla.md §5.3), su error budget y su tasa de consumo.",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "expr": "max by (namespace, replicaset) (time() - kube_replicaset_created{namespace=~\"$namespace\"} < 180)",
        "iconColor": "light-blue",
        "name": "Despliegues",
        "titleFormat": "Despliegue: ReplicaSet nuevo {{replicaset}}",
        "textFormat": "namespace {{namespace}} · sólo un rollout crea un ReplicaSet; un escalado del HPA no",
        "step": "2m"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "name": "Releases",
        "target": {
          "limit": 100,
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": [
            "release"
          ],
          "type": "tags"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "prod",
          "value": "prod"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(environment)",
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Entorno",
        "name": "environment",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "prod",
          "value": "prod"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(sli:namespace_environment:info{environment=\"$environment\"}, namespace)",
        "description": "El namespace del entorno elegido, leído de la regla sli:namespace_environment:info. En la nube es el mismo nombre (dev, prod); en kind el entorno local vive en bank-usac.",
        "hide": 2,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Namespace",
        "name": "namespace",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(sli:namespace_environment:info{environment=\"$environment\"}, namespace)",
          "refId": "namespace"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo se lee",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "El **error budget** es cuánto margen de incumplimiento queda en la ventana de 7 días: `1` es intacto, `0` gastado y un valor negativo significa que el SLO ya se incumplió. El **burn rate** es a qué velocidad se gasta: `1×` agota el presupuesto exactamente al cerrar la ventana, `14.4×` lo agota en doce horas."
      }
    },
